[{"title":"西江月 其一","author":"夏元鼎","text":"行处青牛引道，飞来鹤顶呈丹。\n谈玄玉局在西川。\n此日方当龙汉。\n千载寂寥吾道，可怜平叔多言。\n画蛇添足悟真篇。\n付与谁人修炼。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":52469,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"西江月 其二","author":"夏元鼎","text":"面目本来是道，阴阳造化成丹。\n骑牛寻犊不知原。\n真是三家村汉。\n古圣立言设象，后人得象忘言。\n且如乾画必三川。\n舍此如何烹炼。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":52470,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"沁园春 其一 和吕洞宾","author":"夏元鼎","text":"大道无名，金丹有验，工夫片时。\n似婴儿娇俊，不离门户，盈盈姹女，缓步深帏。\n二八当年，黄婆匹配，隔碍潜通势似危。\n须臾见，见灵明宝藏，一点星飞。\n其时。\n似执躬圭。\n深保护阴阳造化儿。\n转南辰北斗，回风混合，雷轰雨骤，只许天知。\n梦幻浮生，天长地久，云路著鞭休要迟。\n金不坏，合朋合德，三教同归。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":52471,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"沁园春 其三 李将使访道有年，近得旁径。子憩其后圃，且问光透帘帏之秘，不敢隐默，不敢戏传，始以小词，庸谢雅意","author":"夏元鼎","text":"天下江山，无如甘露，多景楼前。\n有谪仙公子，依山傍水，结茅筑圃，花竹森然。\n四季风光，一生乐事，真个壶中别有天。\n亭台巧，一琴一鹤，泥絮心田。\n不须块坐参禅。\n也不要区区学挂冠。\n但对境无心，山林钟鼎，流行坎止，闹里偷闲。\n向上玄关，南辰北斗，昼夜璇玑炼火还。\n分明见，本来面目，不是游魂。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":52472,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"沁园春 其二 和张虚靖","author":"夏元鼎","text":"太极才分，鸿濛凿破，云收雾开。\n见曦魂蟾魄，升沈昼夜，光含万象，机应丹台。\n火里栽莲，水中捉月，两个人人暗去来。\n鹊桥畔，任传神送气，巽户轰雷。\n微哉。\n火候休猜。\n无师授徒劳颜闵材。\n问从头下手，收因结果，争魂夺命，何处胚胎。\n小法旁门，幸勤一世，谩道修真不惹埃。\n争如我，水晶宫里，独步琼阶。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":52473,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"贺新郎 和刘宰潜夫韵","author":"夏元鼎","text":"天上神仙路。\n问谁能、超凡入圣，平虚交付。\n三岛十洲无限景，稳驾鸾舆鹤驭。\n更驯伏、木龙金虎。\n造化小儿真剧戏，炼阳精、要戴乾为父。\n须定力，似愚鲁。\n三旬一遇交乌兔。\n便丹成、天长地久，桑田变否。\n四象五行攒簇处，全藉黄婆真土。\n无私授、人多胡做。\n堪叹红尘声利客，向花朝月夕寻妆妇。\n应不解，乘槎去。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":52474,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"满江红","author":"夏元鼎","text":"人世何为，江湖上、渔蓑堪老。\n鸣榔处，汪汪万顷，清波无垢。\n欸乃一声虚谷应，夷犹短棹关心否。\n向晚来、垂钓傍寒汀，牵星斗。\n砂碛畔，蒹葭茂。\n烟波际，盟鸥友。\n喜清风明月，多情相守。\n紫绶金章朝路险，青蓑箬笠沧溟浩。\n舍浮云、富贵乐天真，酾江酒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":52475,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"满庭芳","author":"夏元鼎","text":"久视长生，登仙大道，思量无甚神通。\n正心诚意，儒释道俱同。\n虽是无为清净，依然要、八面玲珑。\n朝朝见，日乌月兔，造化运西东。\n黄婆能匹配，天机玄妙，朔会相逢。\n正三旬一遇，消息无穷。\n不待存心想肾，非关是、打坐谈空。\n君知否，灵明宝藏，收在水晶宫。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":52476,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题汪水云诗卷","author":"夏天民","text":"仰峰昨夜三尺雪，梅花吟老坐如橛。\n道人啄扉来掺别，茗盌冰胶不堪啜。\n袖中枝桐半皴裂，为予载拊舒郁结。\n谁裁古调多曲折，拍拍胡笳中音节。\n燕山孤累心石铁，神物护持笔生舌。\n杜陵老翁代佛说，长歌自击唾壶缺。\n万古剑铓倒流血，毛发森森照关月。\n于乎嵇康东市计仍拙，广陵一散何尝绝。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":52477,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"奉继冯使君韵 其二","author":"夏世雄","text":"神物坚持多圣境，新诗开僻信贤能。\n磨崖永作山中景，读处留行亦好憎。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":52478,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"奉继冯使君韵 其一","author":"夏世雄","text":"恭览新诗清彻骨，挥毫落处耀名山。\n寒踪久已知恩地，杖屦今朝得喜攀。\n翳雨堙风遮远目，等闲轩豁为谁开。\n天公岂是藏幽景，留待使君持节来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":52479,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题居室","author":"夏龙五","text":"用拙常存守道心，偷闲片片抵千金。\n半帘梅影离离月，一涧泉声曲曲琴。\n图史灯前随意检，园蔬雨后不时寻。\n浮名自觉无多趣，五柳当年志已深。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":52480,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"减字木兰花 宣和庚子登浯台作","author":"夏倪","text":"江涵晓日。\n荡漾波光摇桨入。\n笑指浯溪。\n漫叟雄文锁翠微。\n休嗟不偶。\n归到中州何处有。\n独立风烟。\n湘水浯台总接天。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":52481,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"九日登尧山书事","author":"夏竦","text":"满头黄菊鬓毛斑，曾议皇王对尔颜。\n今日临风轻霸迹，尧山应合胜牛山。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":52482,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"书怀","author":"夏竦","text":"黄阁有贤图国计，皂囊无党害边功。\n河湟饮马无难事，一点沙尘在目中。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":52483,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"内阁春帖子 其四","author":"夏竦","text":"银箭初传暖律延，微和渐扇物华妍。\n彩幡红镂宜春字，永奉宸慈亿万年。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":52484,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"内阁春帖子 其七","author":"夏竦","text":"三星分曜辉宸汉，九禁迎春启令辰。\n仰奉椒闱宣内治，湛恩鸿庆永如春。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":52485,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"内阁春帖子 其一","author":"夏竦","text":"青逵布序和风扇，紫禁延禧瑞日长。\n伫看亲蚕临茧馆，永观彤管播声芳。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":52486,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"内阁春帖子 其五","author":"夏竦","text":"青阳乍整苍龙驾，紫宙初凝白鹤云。\n曼寿无疆真荫远，九重嘉气日氤氲。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":52487,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"内阁春帖子 其二","author":"夏竦","text":"椒花献岁良时启，彩燕迎春淑气来。\n仰奉帝慈方秀出，吹箫看筑凤凰台。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":52488,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"内阁春帖子 其六","author":"夏竦","text":"缇室葭灰飞候管，彤闱天路起和风。\n六宫永被河洲化，穆穆芳猷佐圣功。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":52489,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"内阁春帖子 其三","author":"夏竦","text":"东郊候气回青辂，北阙迎祥辟紫闱。\n大庇群生承宝绪，永敷春泽播鸿徽。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":52490,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"古意","author":"夏竦","text":"重上青楼拂蛛网，却匀愁黛对菱波。\n也知新旧争多少，敢话机头织素多。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":52491,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"再徙西都咏青雀寄张升谏院","author":"夏竦","text":"弱羽伤弓尚未完，孤飞谁敢拟鸳鸾。\n明珠自有千金价，莫为游人作弹丸。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":52492,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"安抚状元内翰还朝复命再获候迎先附短章以代片幅","author":"夏竦","text":"两朝西掖旧词臣，蘖苦冰寒四十春。\n霜雪满头尘满袖，自惭重见玉堂人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":52493,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"廷试","author":"夏竦","text":"殿上衮衣明日月，砚中旗影动龙蛇。\n纵横礼乐三千字，独对丹墀日未斜。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":52494,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"江州琵琶亭","author":"夏竦","text":"年光过眼如车毂，职事羁人似马衔。\n若遇琵琶应大笑，何须涕泣满青衫。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":52495,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"西厅","author":"夏竦","text":"阶除尽日微风度，帘幕先秋暑气还。\n莫讶使君临案久，雨晴端正见南山。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":52496,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"观藏珠","author":"夏竦","text":"敏手机心颇自安，遮藏有路巧千般。\n主公当面无因见，只怕旁人冷眼看。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":52497,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寿春郡王阁春帖子 其一","author":"夏竦","text":"穆穆韶华生紫禁，迟迟春箭下青宫。\n良辰已庆加元服，大国爰闻拜景风。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":52498,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寿春郡王阁春帖子 其三","author":"夏竦","text":"日上苑梅凝素艳，雪晴宫柳弄青条。\n已观寿土封东国，即看怀金奉内朝。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":52499,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寿春郡王阁春帖子 其二","author":"夏竦","text":"缇室葭灰飞律管，凤闱春色动年芳。\n仙源积庆诚无际，永戴宸慈袭美祥。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":52500,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寿春郡王阁春帖子 其四","author":"夏竦","text":"异表英奇非世出，惠心通敏尽生知。\n更当淑景承慈煦，永奉嘉祥茂本枝。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":52501,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"花槛","author":"夏竦","text":"曲槛横栏百宝装，春风容冶看人狂。\n孤松瘦柏无颜色，只有青青待雪霜。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":52502,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"t